menu "ESP32-P4 Elecrow factory-path audio"
    config PLATFORM_AUDIO_FACTORY_ELECROW_10_1_BUILD_ONLY
        bool "Compile the reviewed Elecrow 10.1-inch factory audio initializer"
        default n
        help
            Builds the complete pinned factory hardware initializer: PDM RX
            I2S0 first at 16 kHz mono DSR_8S on GPIO24 clock (1.024 MHz) and
            GPIO26 input, followed by speaker TX I2S1 at 16 kHz PCM16 stereo
            on GPIO21/22/23 with TX MCLK unused and active-low GPIO30. GPIO24
            may fan out through board strapping toward the codec MCLK net.
            This option is a source/build gate for the exact-unit replay
            scope. It is not continuity/population proof, acoustic proof, or
            permission to flash or energize another unit's speakers.
endmenu
